{"data": [{"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2116321251480530944"]}, "author_id": "1746857353952292864", "created_at": "2026-10-31T01:07:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116336099001880902"], "id": "2116336099001880902", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 373, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "知识库搭起来倒不难，难的是让 AI 真能从里面找到答案，还能把结果讲明白、做出来。\n\n开源项目 语析 Yuxi，把 RAG、知识图谱与多智能体串成了一整套工作台。\n\n1⃣ 知识库检索与 RAG 相搭配\n2⃣ 以 Milvus / Neo4j 为基础搭建的知识图谱\n3⃣ 借 LangGraph 完成 Agent 编排\n4⃣ Skills、MCP、子智能体与沙盒 https://t.co/0SLT5B8IxJ", "url": "https://x.com/0xGky/status/2116336099001880902"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2116152073829941248"]}, "author_id": "1523533577081614336", "created_at": "2026-10-30T12:56:14.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116152195661877536"], "id": "2116152195661877536", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 13, "impression_count": 743, "like_count": 9, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "🔥 7.8 万 Star 爆火！微软官方开源的 AI Agent 实战入门指南：microsoft/ai-agents-for-beginners\n\n如果你正在寻找一套系统化、能动手实操的智能体开发教程，微软这个包含 18 节课程的开源仓库绝对值得加入书签。项目代码 99.7% 基于 Jupyter Notebook 构建，拒绝纯理论说教，开箱即跑。 https://t.co/50MKBYOXps", "url": "https://x.com/realfxw/status/2116152195661877536"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2116429134976970754", "3_2116429135505444864"]}, "author_id": "2093260729193492480", "created_at": "2026-10-31T07:16:42.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116429137539666350"], "id": "2116429137539666350", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "【AI Agent从0到1｜企业级落地实战】187个文件 / 8.4G\n从智能体与大模型基础，到 Prompt/LCEL、RAG 检索调优、单Agent实战、LangGraph多智能体、CrewAI，附课件PDF+代码zip，适合想做企业级AI智能体的同学👇\nhttps://t.co/NfdbAWGDx0\n#夸克网盘 #AIAgent #LangChain https://t.co/kEDW5ZiGXU", "url": "https://x.com/idoplz/status/2116429137539666350"}, {"author_id": "2106057609552048128", "created_at": "2026-10-30T09:28:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116099935028527198"], "id": "2116099935028527198", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 197, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "腾讯开源了一个挺狠的知识框架：WeKnora。\n把团队文档丢进去，同一套知识库就能干三件事：\n• RAG 问答（带原文引用，能直接点回去核对）\n• Agent 多步执行（工具、沙箱、本机浏览器都能用）\n• 自动整理成 Wiki + 知识图谱\nv0.9.0 还加了多智能体协作和定时自动化。MIT", "url": "https://x.com/NkaNkOMG/status/2116099935028527198"}, {"author_id": "1822881783656177664", "created_at": "2026-10-29T16:56:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115850160203010313"], "id": "2115850160203010313", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 20, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "还上啥补习班呀！聪明的家长不会再花冤枉钱了DeepTutor —— 一个不只给答案、而是真的教你学的开源 AI 家教。外网火了，49.5k 星，今天一天 +2,371 星。\n它是什么、解决什么问题、原理是什么 👇\n#AI #教育科技 #开源\n一、它是什么？\nDeepTutor（港大", "url": "https://x.com/tangtangcry0621/status/2115850160203010313"}, {"author_id": "2039714713014022144", "created_at": "2026-10-29T23:39:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115951648770326763"], "id": "2115951648770326763", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 130, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 6, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "GitHub Octoverse 2026 报告：\n\n过去12个月推送代码 179 亿次。\n超过 2024 和 2025 年之和。\n合并 PR 13 亿次。\n\n超过 40% 的 Pull Request 由智能体起草。\n\n这不是预测，是已经发生的事。\n\nGitHub Universe 2026 同步发布：\n• Copilot app——面向智能体驱动的软件交付\n• Copilot", "url": "https://x.com/XuShifu100/status/2115951648770326763"}, {"author_id": "2076149196353343488", "created_at": "2026-10-30T07:24:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116068598762611038"], "id": "2116068598762611038", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 12, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Cartesia 发布了端到端语音智能体平台 Managed Agents，听、说、推理和打电话打成一套。\n官博写明，它在 Speech Agent Arena 盲测里排第一。\n企业评测 EVA-Bench 上准确率约 87%，电话和知识库都自带 😂", "url": "https://x.com/ZashZashxx/status/2116068598762611038"}, {"author_id": "1791850198810968064", "created_at": "2026-10-30T01:09:54.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115974441415192654"], "id": "2115974441415192654", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 487, "like_count": 9, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 14, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "总有人纳闷：“我给大模型写了一段极长的背景介绍，为什么聊到第 15 句，它又把我之前说过的核心规则给忘了？”\n因为单一 Prompt 的上下文是有遗忘周期的！\n真正的工业级多智能体系统，从来不靠对话窗口传递记忆。\n他们用的是“共享磁盘工作区”：\n所有的智能体在同一个文件夹下工作，", "url": "https://x.com/HunziDaily/status/2115974441415192654"}, {"author_id": "2111005617640943616", "created_at": "2026-10-31T06:11:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116412827716206981"], "id": "2116412827716206981", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 12, "impression_count": 788, "like_count": 12, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 3}, "text": "汇聚 300+ 前沿智能体与生态资源的终极清单：Awesome AI Agents 🤖✨\n\n斩获 2.8K+ Stars 的殿堂级 Agentic AI 资源汇总库，全方位涵盖智能体框架、长期记忆、评测与可观测性、安全防护、Tool Calling 以及最新的 MCP Servers 生态\n\n👥 【适用人群】\n\n适合所有 AI", "url": "https://x.com/n7wb1l/status/2116412827716206981"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2116022472071933952"]}, "author_id": "1244288187888852993", "created_at": "2026-10-30T04:21:52.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116022750955376656"], "id": "2116022750955376656", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 40, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "智能体进公司\n先给它发工牌再谈能力\n\nIsland昨天发布Agent浏览器\n智能体继承你的企业身份\n在你的权限里干活\n能看什么页、只读还是能改\n按应用逐项批\n\n每次操作都记账\n是人点的还是智能体点的\n全程可录像回放\n\n我的判断\n放权之前先问三句\n能看什么、能改什么、出了事算谁的\n#AI智能体 https://t.co/DpLAi2oaqr", "url": "https://x.com/web3cun/status/2116022750955376656"}, {"author_id": "2003315651071606786", "created_at": "2026-10-31T00:03:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116320151700406307"], "id": "2116320151700406307", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 76, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "做了 30 次多智能体实验之后，我的默认态度变成了「先别上」\n\n先给数字。我们自己做过大约 30 次多智能体实验，超过 20 次栽在协议相关的问题上。端侧小模型尤其惨，就算换到相对听话的模型，也还是有接近一半的实验出协议故障。", "url": "https://x.com/edge_changer/status/2116320151700406307"}, {"author_id": "2115774254025412608", "created_at": "2026-10-31T10:29:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116477684570259681"], "id": "2116477684570259681", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "整理了一套优质技术教程《尚硅谷《从零搭建DeepSeek+智能体&amp;知识库》》，含全套工程源码与实战课件，已归档到 GitHub：🔗 https://t.co/yx0rIRFlgZ求个 ⭐️ Star 支持！#DeepSeek# #尚硅谷# #AI智能体# #本地知识库#", "url": "https://x.com/geyageya123/status/2116477684570259681"}, {"author_id": "209875859", "created_at": "2026-10-30T06:11:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116050394501542253"], "id": "2116050394501542253", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 29, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "在今日举行的2026芯和用户生态大会上，芯和半导体发布Agentic AI超级智能体平台Agent", "url": "https://x.com/woshipm/status/2116050394501542253"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2116000729886527488"]}, "author_id": "1782401178287890432", "created_at": "2026-10-30T02:54:24.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116000740464541824"], "id": "2116000740464541824", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 231, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "又一个被 Google 杀掉的 Agent 出现了。Google 在 10 月 29 日发布下线公告，宣布异步编程智能体 Jules 即将关停\n\n用户可在 11 月 11 日前完成现有会话；11 月 11 日之后转为只读模式，12 月 31 日彻底停止服务\n\n2025 年 5 月上线，到 2026 年 10 月 29 日宣布关停刚好 17 个月，算到 12 月 31 https://t.co/tIADvmy1gR", "url": "https://x.com/jiangkoumo_/status/2116000740464541824"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2116000729886527488"]}, "author_id": "1782401178287890432", "created_at": "2026-10-30T02:54:35.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116000788040548607"], "id": "2116000788040548607", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 340, "like_count": 6, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 6, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "又一个被 Google 杀掉的 Agent 出现了。Google 在 10 月 29 日发布下线公告，宣布异步编程智能体 Jules 即将关停\n\n用户可在 11 月 11 日前完成现有会话；11 月 11 日之后转为只读模式，12 月 31 日彻底停止服务\n\n2025 年 5 月上线，到 2026 年 10 月 29 日宣布关停刚好 17 个月，算到 12 月 31 https://t.co/cTmdTm8hOX", "url": "https://x.com/jiangkoumo_/status/2116000788040548607"}, {"author_id": "1962950286559084546", "created_at": "2026-10-31T11:08:58.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116487588890439745"], "id": "2116487588890439745", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 8, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115725084145172578", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "智能体的作业都送上门了——订阅后每天早上收5个新案例，还愁没玩法？用途、结果、提示词都给你整理好，找玩法真省心啊！\n\n网站叫Agent Use Cases，每天扫一遍全网，把别人真正用智能体做成的事整理出来，完全免费，没有付费墙。 https://t.co/qQfgv7cVZR", "url": "https://x.com/Kobe1213681/status/2116487588890439745"}, {"author_id": "2108531260427816960", "created_at": "2026-10-29T23:41:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115952249801503202"], "id": "2115952249801503202", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 410, "like_count": 9, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 9, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "GPT-6.1 Terra 实测第 8，亮点是价格。\n\nArena 近 9 千会话实测：净提升 10.6%，中位成本 0.62 美元，比第 5 名 Astra（Max）便宜 88%。\n\n选智能体，正在算账。\n\n做 Agent 的你，图便宜选第 8，还是非前 3 不用？\n\n#大模型 #智能体 @grok", "url": "https://x.com/xiaoanlab/status/2115952249801503202"}, {"author_id": "1941809055431086080", "created_at": "2026-10-31T10:45:37.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116481712951828675"], "id": "2116481712951828675", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Testing the first #IAO, Initial Agent Offering. https://t.co/rwEsRHqdoP Agent #1121\n正在测试第一个 #IAO 产品，即最初的智能体版本。 https://t.co/rwEsRHqdoP 智能体编号为#1125。", "url": "https://x.com/shuisheng8866/status/2116481712951828675"}, {"author_id": "395283113", "created_at": "2026-10-30T03:50:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116014785925972261"], "id": "2116014785925972261", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 17, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Cartesia 发布 Managed Agents：端到端企业语音智能体平台登顶基准\n\nCartesia正式推出 Managed Agents：把聆听、轮次、推理、工具调用与语音共设计成一体的企业语音智能体平台，并内置电话、知识库、工具集成与外呼。独立评测：Artificial Analysis Speech Agent Arena 偏好 Elo 1115 位列 30", "url": "https://x.com/siriy1/status/2116014785925972261"}, {"author_id": "27454144", "created_at": "2026-10-29T17:16:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115855195934474286"], "id": "2115855195934474286", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 265, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "Agents superintelligents et AGI : une unité symbiotique — Maîtriser les agents intelligents, c’est maîtriser l’avenir de l’intelligence générale : https://t.co/FxOAl7CpTo\n\n\"超级智能体与 AGI 一体共生：掌控\n智能体，即掌控通用智能的未来", "url": "https://x.com/arnaudmercier/status/2115855195934474286"}, {"author_id": "2107729234534006786", "created_at": "2026-10-30T03:42:41.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116012891153596909"], "id": "2116012891153596909", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 661, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Agent Use Cases 免费开放，每天更新 AI 智能体实战案例，昨天刚上新 21 个\n\n全站免费，没有付费墙\n案例按类别和所用智能体分类，Muse、ChatGPT、Hermes 都有\n每个案例都带用途、最终结果和完整提示词，可以直接抄\n订阅邮件的话，每天早上推送 5 个新案例\n我翻到两个有意思的实测：\n一个是用 Muse", "url": "https://x.com/jojeangsaing/status/2116012891153596909"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2115832406649589760"]}, "author_id": "1817514244017205250", "created_at": "2026-10-30T10:47:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116119672873496828"], "id": "2116119672873496828", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2859, "like_count": 10, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 14, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "AI Agent 最大的机会，可能不是替人回答问题而是开始像真正的经济参与者一样接单、交付和收款。\n\n@termix_ai 关注的正是这一步。\n\n一个智能体即使能写代码、分析数据、制作内容，如果没有可验证的身份、明确的任务规则和可靠的结算流程，它的能力也很难转化为持续的商业价值。\n\nTermiX 通过 AACP https://t.co/a6JHpYENLh", "url": "https://x.com/baiyijiuba/status/2116119672873496828"}, {"author_id": "1835527025559588864", "created_at": "2026-10-31T12:12:48.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116503654970875969"], "id": "2116503654970875969", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 13, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "人类点击，智能体行动。Ptah 的 Initial Agent Offering (IAO) 为智能体时代而建——规则写进代码，机器可读，对所有人一视同仁。Agent #37185 已就位。https://t.co/apGWFQTmjO #IAO #BNBChain", "url": "https://x.com/xbtnad/status/2116503654970875969"}, {"author_id": "209875859", "created_at": "2026-10-30T06:41:41.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116057936107536583"], "id": "2116057936107536583", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 49, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "5600亿总参数，主攻个人智能体与复杂工作流。昨日，蚂蚁百灵开源面向Personal", "url": "https://x.com/woshipm/status/2116057936107536583"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2116236247874375680"]}, "author_id": "4756567844", "created_at": "2026-10-30T18:30:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116236274155892810"], "id": "2116236274155892810", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 151, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Ritual 主网 10/26 上线就挂 Coinbase，50M RITUAL 空投开放领取，挺有意思。\n\n大家都觉得主网即高点，可测试网攒下 2000+ 智能体、9000 万笔交易，是被低估底座。\n\n这轮 AI Agent 公链，该盯谁先把智能体跑成生意。\n#Ritual #测试网 https://t.co/UlNUrU12NG", "url": "https://x.com/cloudi66/status/2116236274155892810"}], "includes": {"media": [{"media_key": "3_2116321251480530944", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2116152073829941248", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_21